cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. CC BY 4.0 requires attribution."
title: "Robot Lawn Mower Specs & Scores"
abstract: >-
  An open, cited dataset of 23 wire-free and RTK robot lawn mowers across 9 brands:
  navigation type, maximum lawn area, slope capability, cutting specs, dated price
  snapshots, and a transparent 0-5 BestRobotMower Score (a documented weighted function
  of the cited specs) for every shipping model.
type: dataset
authors:
